  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Insufficient information has been provided regarding net loss or gain of jobs to satisfy Officers that the proposed change in use would be acceptable within the Kingsbury Town Centre, as required by National Planning Policy Framework Paragraph 90 (2023), London Plan Policy GG1 (2021), Harrow Core Strategy Policy CS1 and CS9 (2012) and Harrow Development Management Policy DM31 (2013).",
    "Insufficient information has been provided in support of the application to satisfy Officers that parking, pedestrian arrangements, trip generation and servicing to the property would not be contrary to London Plan Policies T2, T3, T4, T5, T6 and T7 (2021), Harrow Core Strategy Policy CS1 (2012) and Harrow Development Management Policies 42, DM44 and DM45 (2013).&nbsp;",
    "Insufficient information has been provided in support of the application to satisfy Officers that carbon dioxide and air quality impacts would not be contrary to London Plan Policies SI1 and SI2 (2021), and Harrow Development Management Policy DM12 (2013).&nbsp;",
    "Insufficient information has been provided relating to proposed hours of operation, noise and odour assessments, and traffic generation details for example, to satisfy officers that the proposed change in use would not unreasonably harm the amenity of surrounding neighbours, including neighbouring business operations, as required by Harrow Core Strategy Policy CS1 (2012) and Harrow Development Management Policy DM1 (2013)."
  ],
